title: With the diff on (lines folded) a symbol inside the folded lines of a changed file must still be found (select step_9), a function that only exists in removed lines must not become a symbol (select step_6), and search in files must give the same hits as with the diff off
folders: git-changes
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: no symbol named 'step_9'
forbid-log: relations of 'step_6'
forbid-log: search 'step_': (?!14 )[0-9]+ hits

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1000
zoom 0.5
select step_9
wait 1200
mark 1-plain-step-9
wait 500
select step_6
wait 800
search step_
wait 1500
mark 2-plain-search
wait 500
left changes
diff on
wait 1500
select step_9
wait 1200
mark 3-diff-step-9
wait 500
select step_6
wait 1200
mark 4-diff-step-6
wait 500
search step_
wait 1500
mark 5-diff-search
wait 500
right symbols
wait 1200
mark 6-diff-symbols-panel
wait 500
diff off
wait 1200
quit
